/-!
A split at each index points to one of 654 certified primes of the form x²+1.
The factor hints evaluate totients multiplicatively. Each large-prime certificate
checks a multiplicative generator against the prime divisors of x, which are
exactly the possible prime divisors of (x²+1)−1.
-/
